<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Masmuda</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Masmuda were a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/berbers">Berber</a> tribal confederation of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/atlas-mountains">High Atlas</a> and western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/morocco">Morocco</a>. They provided the core support for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-tumart">Ibn Tumart</a>'s <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almohad-caliphate">Almohad</a> movement and its military forces. Masmuda leaders held a privileged position in the government of the Almohad <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">Caliphate</a>.</p></div>
